# Allowlist, not a deny list: the build context is exactly the inputs the two
# builds read, so nothing new — a doc, a scratch file, a private key — can reach
# a layer by being added to the repo. The runtime stage copies three artifacts
# out of the builder, so none of this ships either way.
*

!package.json
!bun.lock
!tsconfig.json
!scripts
!src
!web

# ...minus everything under web/ that is generated or installed
web/node_modules
web/.svelte-kit
web/.svelte-kit-dev
web/build
